My personal Brouter profiles for use with Brouter-Web and Brouter on Android with Locus Maps.

On Smartphone for use in Locus Maps, copy profile to Internal Storage/Android/data/menion.android.locus.pro/files/Locus/router/profiles2/
Then in Locus Maps: Settings - Navigation - Router: Routing profile, EXTERNAL PROFILES

on Android 15 copy works only by starting Shizuku, then copy with X-Plore

Shizuku:
Android Settings - Developer options - Debugging - Wireless debugging on (needs to be done every time)
tap Wireless debugging - Pair device with pairing code
in Shizuku Start via wireless debugging - Pairing
tap notification 'Pairing service found' - Enter pairing code - Send
'You can start Shizuku service now'
Shizuku - Start
Shizuku is running
Authorized 1 application (X-Plore)

X-Plore:
screen to landscape mode
navigate to source left and destination right
long tap file - Move
